Occupational Health and Safety Software comprises digital platforms that enable organisations to manage workplace risk, incident reporting, compliance tracking, and employee health monitoring. These solutions integrate incident management, audit modules, training administration, and analytics dashboards to support regulatory adherence and a proactive safety culture.
